<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last year.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last year.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the year to January 10.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in year</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Howard Smith		10.35	     62.23</p>
<p>2   Brambles		    23.40	     52.94</p>
<p>3   HIH Winterthur	     3.15	     51.72</p>
<p>4   James Hardie		 3.65	     51.45</p>
</text>
